1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,989
Picture this.

2
00:00:01,009 --> 00:00:04,393
You ask your agency for your
code, and they say: pay us first.

3
00:00:04,475 --> 00:00:05,377
It happens.

4
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:06,835
And it’s easy to prevent.

5
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:11,105
Put your code, your domain and your
hosting in your own name, from day one.

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,958
Your agency gets access.

7
00:00:12,978 --> 00:00:14,218
You keep ownership.

